WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:06,300
This should be the so-called ledger, right?

2
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:13,090
This should be it. You found it. What are you doing? I've given it to you. I've had enough fun. Let's go quickly.

3
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:14,450
Do you really don’t want it?

4
00:00:14,770 --> 00:00:18,210
What if this affects the clearance rating? It’s useless if I don’t want it.

5
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:21,790
This may also become a prop

6
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,550
If the Rou family doesn't want me, you're welcome.

7
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:25,910
Those two humans ate my success

8
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:27,350
Why wasn't it polluted?

9
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:31,660
I didn’t expect that my teammates who were following me would suddenly be wiped out.

10
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,120
If I hadn’t turned on my talent at the last minute

11
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,160
Three seconds forgotten

12
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,680
Make the Boss forget that I'm here too

13
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,140
I'm afraid I'll die too
